OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy over
OL,6,Fthe Caithness, Sutherland and the east
OL,7,Fwith some outbreaks of mainly light
OL,8,Frain, becoming mostly dry overnight.
OL,9,FDry with some clear spells in the
OL,10,Fwest, turning cloudier overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FMostly dry but somewhat
OL,13,Fcloudy to start but bright or sunny
OL,14,Fspells developing through the day, as
OL,15,Fwell the odd shower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
