OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FThen
OL,6,Frain or showers at times, occasionally
OL,7,Fheavy, along with some drier and
OL,8,Fbrighter spells. Winds will be mostly
OL,9,Flight on Sunday, freshening on Monday
OL,10,Fand Tuesday.
